WEBVTT

00:06:59.373 --> 00:07:01.750
from participating in these communities.

00:07:02.293 --> 00:07:03.294
Here’s an example.

00:07:04.962 --> 00:07:08.507
One author told us she started writing
fanfiction at age 13

00:07:08.507 --> 00:07:12.094
when she had this intense crush
on a fictional character.

00:07:13.137 --> 00:07:14.138
(Sighs)

00:07:14.138 --> 00:07:18.642
It led her to write fanfiction
with phrases like

00:07:18.642 --> 00:07:21.312
“gorgeous cerulean orbs”, or

00:07:21.312 --> 00:07:23.314
(Laughter)

00:07:23.314 --> 00:07:25.357
“manly hunks of muscle.”

00:07:25.483 --> 00:07:26.484
(Laughter)

00:07:26.817 --> 00:07:28.569
Kind of embarrassing.

00:07:28.611 --> 00:07:29.612
(Laughter)